{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26013","headline":"山中冬思二首 二 · 鲍溶","name":"山中冬思二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雪壮冰亦坚，冻涧如平地。\n幽人毛褐煖，笑就糟牀醉。\n唤人空谷应，开火寒猨至。\n拾薪煮秋栗，看鼎书古字。\n忽忆南涧游，衣巾多云气。\n露脚寻逸僧，谘量意中事。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26013.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26013","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}